    "name": "Tobacco Shop Simulator: Prologue",
    "steam_appid": 3211690,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Tobacco Shop Simulator: Prologue is a free prologue version of Tobacco Shop Simulator. In this game, you'll have a limited amount of contracts.]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person simulation game where you step into the role of a tobacco shop owner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work alone or with friends to expand your humble shop into a huge tobacco shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211690/extras/77751ef58ec2f0c8895cd03529b49130.poster.avif?t=1750239473\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211690/extras/77751ef58ec2f0c8895cd03529b49130.webm?t=1750239473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211690/extras/77751ef58ec2f0c8895cd03529b49130.mp4?t=1750239473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-Op Mode and Single Player</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the duties with your friends in co-op mode (for up to 4 players).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more players in the store, the more demanding customers will visit your store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, you can go solo and manage everything in the store. You can invite your friends anytime if you change your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211690/extras/d44bdfb13ed100a98376407dad16a248.poster.avif?t=1750239473\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211690/extras/d44bdfb13ed100a98376407dad16a248.webm?t=1750239473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211690/extras/d44bdfb13ed100a98376407dad16a248.mp4?t=1750239473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Store Workflow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sign contracts with leading brands, order new products with an in-game computer or with your tablet while walking in the store, unpack the boxes, place the products into your store, and set the prices for your products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consider the market prices while setting up your product prices in the store for customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always keep your store clean so as not to lose any customers. Also, be careful with the thieves to avoid some box losses that would cause a leak in your finances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211690/extras/ed144550ffcb2929e41d716840ad6cdd.poster.avif?t=1750239473\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211690/extras/ed144550ffcb2929e41d716840ad6cdd.webm?t=1750239473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211690/extras/ed144550ffcb2929e41d716840ad6cdd.mp4?t=1750239473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Products</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please make sure your customers find all their needs in the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always expand your product portfolio and satisfy your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cigarettes, lighters, pipes, cigars, ashtrays, hookahs, e-cigarettes, tobacco, and smoking accessories... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware of the market prices and purchase more products when they're cheap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211690/extras/a24ba52ce59a66ae0030434c4e4e7df5.poster.avif?t=1750239473\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211690/extras/a24ba52ce59a66ae0030434c4e4e7df5.webm?t=1750239473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211690/extras/a24ba52ce59a66ae0030434c4e4e7df5.mp4?t=1750239473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place a sufficient number of checkouts to reduce the waiting time for customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan products and collect payments whether in cash or with card purchases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to fulfill the online orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211690/extras/1cbbbb14f261055edbcf835336dfe39e.poster.avif?t=1750239473\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211690/extras/1cbbbb14f261055edbcf835336dfe39e.webm?t=1750239473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211690/extras/1cbbbb14f261055edbcf835336dfe39e.mp4?t=1750239473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expansions and New Teammates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your store and warehouse by leveling up your store and budget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire stockers to fill the racks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase more cash registers and hire new cashiers to minimize long queues at the checkouts and to reduce waiting time for customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211690/extras/565d92663364aad188d282ce8ca57c44.poster.avif?t=1750239473\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211690/extras/565d92663364aad188d282ce8ca57c44.webm?t=1750239473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211690/extras/565d92663364aad188d282ce8ca57c44.mp4?t=1750239473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
