're cheap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211690/extras/a24ba52ce59a66ae0030434c4e4e7df5.poster.avif?t=1750239473\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211690/extras/a24ba52ce59a66ae0030434c4e4e7df5.webm?t=1750239473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211690/extras/a24ba52ce59a66ae0030434c4e4e7df5.mp4?t=1750239473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place a sufficient number of checkouts to reduce the waiting time for customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan products and collect payments whether in cash or with card purchases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to fulfill the online orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211690/extras/1cbbbb14f261055edbcf835336dfe39e.poster.avif?t=1750239473\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211690/extras/1cbbbb14f261055edbcf835336dfe39e.webm?t=1750239473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211690/extras/1cbbbb14f261055edbcf835336dfe39e.mp4?t=1750239473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expansions and New Teammates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your store and warehouse by leveling up your store and budget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire stockers to fill the racks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase more cash registers and hire new cashiers to 